<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Racklatina – En mantenimiento</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --bg: #060d1a;
            --card: #0d1b2e;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            --accent: #2563eb;
            --accent-glow: rgba(37,99,235,0.35);
            --text: #f1f5f9;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --muted2: #94a3b8;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Fondo animado */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -10%, rgba(37,99,235,0.18) 0%, transparent 70%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 80% 80%, rgba(99,102,241,0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* Grid sutil de fondo */
        body::after {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 60px 60px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .wrapper {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Logo */
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        .logo img {
            height: 40px;
            filter: brightness(1.1);
        }

        /* Card */
        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 3rem 3.5rem;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow:
                0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04) inset,
                0 32px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
                0 0 80px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        /* Ícono animado */
        .icon-wrap {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37,99,235,0.2), rgba(99,102,241,0.15));
            border: 1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .icon-wrap svg {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            color: #60a5fa;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(37,99,235,0.3); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(37,99,235,0); }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        p {
            font-size: 0.975rem;
            color: var(--muted2);
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        /* Divider */
        .divider {
            width: 40px;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
            margin: 1.75rem auto;
            border-radius: 9999px;
        }

        /* Status badge */
        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
            background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.2);
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: #93c5fd;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        }
        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #3b82f6;
            animation: blink 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.2; }
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        .footer a {
            color: var(--muted2);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .footer a:hover { color: var(--text); }

        @media (max-width: 540px) {
            .card { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">

        <div class="logo">
            <img src="/images/logo-racklatina-light.png" alt="Racklatina"
                 onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span style=\'color:#94a3b8;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em\'>RACKLATINA</span>'">
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon-wrap">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
                    <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
                    <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <h1>Portal en mantenimiento</h1>

            <p>
                Estamos realizando actualizaciones para mejorar tu experiencia.<br>
                El portal estará disponible en breve.
            </p>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="status">
                <span class="status-dot"></span>
                Trabajando en ello — volvemos pronto
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            ¿Tenés una urgencia? Contactanos en
            <a href="mailto:info@racklatina.com.ar">info@racklatina.com.ar</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
